      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i'm looking for more depth for my literature review though. some people argue that socioeconomic status doesn't fully account for the gap because even when you control for income, there's still a difference. can you expand on the other theories? specifically, what are the arguments regarding 'cultural' differences or even more controversial theories like the ones involving cognitive or biological explanations? i need to understand the full spectrum of what's been debated in the past.",
